	<Item Name="title" Type="String">Systematic interrogation of tumor cell resistance to chimeric antigen receptor T cell therapy in pancreatic cancer</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">TFAP4 scored strongly in our screen for MSLN CAR T cell resistance; to interogate its function, we performed RNAseq following TFAP4 knockdown and overexpression in HupT3 pancreatic cancer cells.</Item>
